  "decision_conditions": [
    "The two-storey side extension, and gable end and rear dormer roof extensions, by reason of their excessive scale, prominent siting, lack of any set in to the side boundary and roof design, appear visually intrusive, overly dominant and out of keeping with the character and appearance of the subject dwelling, the adjoining properties, and the immediately surrounding area. The development is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD6, DMD13, DMD14 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
